David Justiss wrote:
>
> I've been playing mostly healers recently (as you can tell from my
> posts in the last month or so), and I'm getting really frustrated.
> Pets never do what I want them to.  Every way to control or train a
> pet required resources that a level 1 healer doesn't have.

No character class starts with a ressource to have full control over
his pet.

But healers are good to inspect the status of hostile creatures while
in melee and also to keep track of the HP status of your pet (which is
helpful in case of your watch captain problem below).

